ies ninjutsu with tech.</li><li>Evidence around Ninjutsu is classified as fiction on Ton-o-Lore.</li>\n    </ul>\n</section>","overview":"<section class=\"overview\">\n    <h2>What is Ninjutsu?</h2>\n    \n    <p>\n        Ninjutsu is the ninja discipline <a href=\"/teenage-mutant-ninja-turtles/new-york-city/turtle-lair/master-splinter\" class=\"entity-link\">Master Splinter</a> teaches <a href=\"/teenage-mutant-ninja-turtles/new-york-city/turtle-lair/leonardo\" class=\"entity-link\">Leonardo</a>, <a href=\"/teenage-mutant-ninja-turtles/new-york-city/turtle-lair/raphael\" class=\"entity-link\">Raphael</a>, <a href=\"/teenage-mutant-ninja-turtles/new-york-city/turtle-lair/donatello\" class=\"entity-link\">Donatello</a>, and <a href=\"/teenage-mutant-ninja-turtles/new-york-city/turtle-lair/michelangelo\" class=\"entity-link\">Michelangelo</a> for stealth, combat, and teamwork.\n    </p>\n    \n    <p class=\"also-known-as\">\n        <strong>Also known as:</strong>\n        ninja arts, ninja training.\n    </p>\n\n</section>","word_count":249,"uniqueness_score":"0.4880"},"entity":{"id":"ca68f931-ea95-4171-9b4e-307bd75d10d2","name":"Ninjutsu","slug":"ninjutsu","type":"concept","short_description":"Martial art taught to the turtles by Splinter.","description":"Ninjutsu is the ninja discipline Master Splinter teaches Leonardo, Raphael, Donatello, and Michelangelo for stealth, combat, and teamwork.","evidence":"fiction","universe":"teenage-mutant-ninja-turtles","aliases":["ninja arts","ninja training"],"wikipedia_url":null,"image_url":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tmnt/images/b/b8/Ninjutsu_kanji_characters_b.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/360?cb=20240828193736","image_source":"https://turtlepedia.fandom.com/wiki/Ninjutsu","image_credit":"Fair-use identification thumbnail via Fandom. Character / franchise art © Mirage / Nickelodeon / Paramount (as applicable). Not free or redistributable artwork.","image_license":"fair_use","image_usage":"fair_use_identificat